id: CTB-SRC0008-7-1
source: SRC-0008
section: §7.1
kind: requirement
scope: ESC
title: Supplementary human-decision criteria
depends: LXM-REQ-000016
applied-in: STG-00 #1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000016
decision: LXM-DEC-000014
text: In addition to the conditions in LXM-REQ-000016, ask the owner when (S1) a material ambiguity remains that the authoritative sources and recorded evidence cannot resolve without choosing between meanings, or (S2) a consequential security, legal, data or operational risk cannot be accepted on existing authority. Each such request uses the same single consolidated decision packet and is never made for routine technical choices.
